About the Author
================

Eng. Salah Allsayani is a Senior Full-Stack Engineer with over 10 years of professional experience in software engineering, project management, system architecture, security, and AI integration. Graduating from the Alsaeed Faculty of Engineering & IT at Taiz University in Yemen, Eng. Salah has dedicated his career to building robust, scalable, and secure software systems.

With deep expertise spanning the full software development lifecycle — from requirements engineering and agile methodologies to security & cyber defense and AI-integrated architecture — Eng. Salah has authored this comprehensive professional skill package to empower fellow engineers, project managers, and software professionals worldwide.

His work reflects a commitment to excellence in engineering practices, continuous improvement, and knowledge sharing across the global developer community.

